OL,3,GNEWSATowns and villages shine a light  
OL,4,Aon Christmas                           
OL,6,FTowns, villages and harbours are being 
OL,7,Flight up for the festive season with   
OL,8,Fspecial events held to mark the start  
OL,9,Fof Christmas.                          
OL,11,FA crime writer is among those leading  
OL,12,Fthe countdown as the lights are        
OL,13,Fswitched on in the South West and      
OL,14,FChannel Islands during celebrations    
OL,15,Fthat have become community traditions. 
OL,17,FIn one seaside village the event is a  
OL,18,Ffundraiser for the RNLI to help it     
OL,19,Fcontinue its lifesaving work off the   
OL,20,Fcoast while others also raise money for
OL,21,Flocal causes.                          
